  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nae Babiloni egesusuro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana Isaya, mosinto bw’Amosi, aroche igoro ya Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenenia ebendera igoro ase egetunwa getari na mete; aka eriogi rinene ase abasikari, basime namaboko basoe ase ebiita bi’abaanto abasike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche omonyene nachiikire aba neatananeire koba abachenu, narangeirie abanto baane bare chituoni baikeranie aya nachiikire ase endamwamu yane. Abanto abwo bagokerete obobui bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tegerera moigwe amariogi ’emeganda y’abanto bakwoga igoro ase ebitunwa! Tegerera moigwe amariogi ay’ookong’ung’ura kw’amarwoti ’ebisaku asangererekanire amo. Omonene bw’Emeganda nkoroberia are emeganda y’esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene ngocha are amo nebirwanero bi’endamwamu yaye korwa ense y’aare, ase chinsinyo chia igoro, erinde asirie ense yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe rera nobororo, ekiagera rituko ri’Omonene riabereire ang’e; nigo rirachiche buna ogosiria gokorwa ase Omonene Omobui.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, amaboko ’abaanto bonsi nigo araborwe chinguru, ne chinkoro chiabo chirianyeke ase obwoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto mbabe nobwoba obonene; inababe nomoichano na obororo. Ee, mbabe nobororo buna obw’omokuungu okobina agonkie, mbarigereranie bare nogokumia na omoichano na amaiso abo amwame ti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, rituko ri’Omonene ngocha rire; nigo rire ritindi ri’ekeririanda na endamwamu ekobera, ndisarie ense ebe bosa na gosiria kegima abanyabibe bamenyeteo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ching’enang’eni chire igoro, na ebiombe biamwabo, tichikorua oborabu bwabo; erioba naribe omosunte ekero rigosoka mambia, na omotienyi tokobara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene ning’ee ense egesusuro ase engencho y’obobe bwaye, na abanyabibe ase engencho y’ogosaria kwabo. Ninsirie obomwenu bw’abwo bare abatindi, ninkeyie oboenenu bw’abaichire nobochege.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkore omobaro o Mwanyabaanto obe omoke kobua oyo bw’etaabu echenire, ee, omobaro obo nobe omoke kobua oyo bw’etaabu ekorwa Ofiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko ri’ekeririanda kiane inche Omonene bw’Emeganda nintengechie igoro chionsi na inyegerie ense erue aase aye goetera ase endamwamu yane ekobera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omonto nabe buna engabi egoserigwa, na buna ching’ondi chitari nomorisia; kera oyomo nairane ase abanto baye, na kera oyomo natame gochia ase ense yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde bwensi oranyorwe, nabetwe ritimo, na onde bwensi orabwatwe, naitwe n’omoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana babo ebing’werere mbasenyentwe ase amasio ’abaibori babo, chinyomba chiabo nchisakorwe, na abakungu babo mbakorerwe ay’obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, inche Omonene ninseegete Abamedi abwo batabare chifeta ne chitaabu koba nengencho enene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo mbaite abamura b’abwo ase okobabeta chinsara, tibakororera abana bare inda, gose abana bande, amaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babiloni oyio ore obonene bw’amarwoti, na obwari na obonene bw’Abakalidayo, nobe buna Sodomu na Gomora, ekero Nyasae konya ayosaririe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babiloni tokomenywa nonya ng’ake nebiaare binde bionsi, nonya n’Omoarabu tagotenenia eema yaye agwo, gose abarisia tibakorenta ching’ondi ne chimbori chitimokereo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ching’iti chi’orosana nchimenyeo, ne chinyakweumia nchiichore ase chinyomba chireo, chisagero nchibe chimenyeteo, na amarengari nabe akona‐gotenga aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinyang’au nchibe chikwamuma ase emerobiri yabo, ne chisese chi’orosana nchibe chikorera ase chinyomba chiabo chi’obonene. Engaki yaye yaikire ang’e; amatuko aye tagotambeeigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
